(7662526, 1248658, 67145, '<td valign="top">a very strong image for the challenge .. <br/>and i can see this with a blue ribbon under it .. <br/>it really is a great sadness when a person makes the choice to end their life .. <br/>but i''m not sure if it is the ultimate sadness .. as there are so many .. <br/>a person living alone and dying without anyone knowing .. thats pretty sad .. <br/>parents who live in disharmony and pass their disfuntion on to their children ..<br/>i could go on .. <br/>i find the lighting in this photo interesting .. <br/>is the person looking at that set-up and deliberating whether to do it or not .. maybe the light is like a message ... of hope .. if he or she doesnt do it .. can their life become meaningful and full of joy .. anything is possible ..</td>', 'a very strong image for the challenge .. and i can see this with a blue ribbon under it .. it really is a great sadness when a person makes the choice to end their life .. but i''m not sure if it is the ultimate sadness .. as there are so many .. a person living alone and dying without anyone knowing .. thats pretty sad .. parents who live in disharmony and pass their disfuntion on to their children ..i could go on .. i find the lighting in this photo interesting .. is the person looking at that set-up and deliberating whether to do it or not .. maybe the light is like a message ... of hope .. if he or she doesnt do it .. can their life become meaningful and full of joy .. anything is possible ..', '2020-05-13 23:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
